                                                "example_id": "81fc657a-be48-441c-bf2c-e2767880bdd7",
                                                "sense_id": "fb85d065-bf41-3607-8a91-b5509cdf9c92",
                                                "text": "Around the same time, \"wholesome\" memes of cute doggos and puppers rejuvenated social media feeds that seemed daily filled with fresh horrors."
                                            },
