                                                "example_id": "c2ab7243-9944-4e69-9fb1-b936d4730f97",
                                                "sense_id": "fb85d065-bf41-3607-8a91-b5509cdf9c92",
                                                "text": "‘It’s OK, you’re allowed out here. There haven’t been any other doggos in this garden since …’ He shrugged. ‘I dunno, forever.’ His grandmother hadn’t had a dog, and she’d lived in the cottage for decades. ‘Doggos?’ he said out loud. ‘Did I just say “doggos”?’"
